# 🚀 Level Up Life

**Level Up Life** is a gamified habit-tracking and self-improvement web application designed to turn your real-world tasks and habits into character growth.

## ✨ Features
- **Gamified Tracking:** Treat your daily habits like an RPG character's stats (Strength, Intelligence, Ability).
- **Secure Authentication:** Fully integrated with **Firebase Authentication** supporting both Google Sign-In and Email/Password login.
- **Session Persistence:** Manages user sessions securely using browser storage and real-time backend verification.
- **Modern UI:** Clean, dark-themed dashboard designed for focus and productivity.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6)
- **Backend & Auth:** Firebase Auth (Google & Email/Password)
- **Deployment:** GitHub Pages

